{"id":"2167509509","kind":"answer","title":"anki中筛选过滤器如何有效使用\"使用第二个过滤器\"?","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"知乎问答实战","date":"2021-10-12","updated":"2021-10-12","votes":11,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":312,"keywords":["Anki","卡片搜索","间隔重复","牌组管理"],"summary":"就是取个并集的关系。Filter1: 条件1 + Filter2:条件2，得到的结果就是把各自满足条件的卡片一起放到筛选牌组中。 可能你会问，直接用 OR 不就能实现并集了么？ 确实是这样的。但是一个筛选器 + OR，只能控制卡片的总数： 但两个筛选器，就能分别控制两组卡片的比例了： 还能分别控制卡片的出现顺序，可玩性就很高…","question_detail_html":"<p>ank 这几个 过滤器是怎么合作的 ?</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/490852938/answer/2167509509","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"xWRdxxbv\">就是取个并集的关系。Filter1: 条件1 + Filter2:条件2，得到的结果就是把各自满足条件的卡片一起放到筛选牌组中。</p><p data-pid=\"x_CWMuS9\">可能你会问，直接用 OR 不就能实现并集了么？</p><p data-pid=\"ZGhAEz9V\">确实是这样的。但是一个筛选器 + OR，只能控制卡片的总数：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7122154e26bca673ac8690a5b7a3e4a7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-450c4fa403adfc61760ed41eb4e053a5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-450c4fa403adfc61760ed41eb4e053a5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"749\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7122154e26bca673ac8690a5b7a3e4a7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-450c4fa403adfc61760ed41eb4e053a5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-450c4fa403adfc61760ed41eb4e053a5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"749\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"_nRdVAXM\">但两个筛选器，就能分别控制两组卡片的比例了：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-a224cc50c3a349bfc40654af3b16fdf4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e8b79793b8319868c7784009ea391513\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e8b79793b8319868c7784009ea391513_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"734\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-a224cc50c3a349bfc40654af3b16fdf4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e8b79793b8319868c7784009ea391513\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e8b79793b8319868c7784009ea391513_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"734\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"BZxMhZ7L\">还能分别控制卡片的出现顺序，可玩性就很高。（不要乱玩）</p><p data-pid=\"ZrjWKJtX\">搭配以下两篇文章食用更佳：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d28d0ab92b4b5442f13e9f3393c0a19d_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"594\" data-image-width=\"667\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/94067520\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">弥乱：[实用]蓝色牌组:啊哈哈哈,高阶魔法</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8bef13b40f868e627e1c5074ce345480_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1076\" data-image-width=\"1097\" data-tm-id=\"48318470\" href=\"#/post/48318470\">叶峻峣：如何正确利用 「Anki」强大的卡片查找功能？</a><p data-pid=\"6Ga1PxBq\">关于筛选牌组的应用实例，请见：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e4cf725e026d6bc412dbc5beb0f4d7d7_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1178\" data-image-width=\"1514\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/answer/1945096976\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Anki牌组参数该怎样设置，不会产生太多的刷卡压力？</a><p data-pid=\"CKYvwzts\">参考文献：</p><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://docs.ankiweb.net/filtered-decks.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Filtered Decks - Anki Manual</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"48318470","title":"如何正确利用 「Anki」强大的卡片查找功能？","author":"Anki","votes":320,"minutes":5,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"46627362","title":"疑问:我如何与其他人合作